[ ncrc ]
Neuronal culture reservoir computing simulator
==========================
A respository showing python code to replicate the reservoir computing simulations of [1].

by: Akke Mats Houben (akkemats.houben@ub.edu -- akke@akkehouben.net)

==========================
To get started, look at the examples directory.

==========================
Requirements:
    - numpy
    - nc_sim (git@github.com:akkeh/nc_sim.git)
    - keras
    - scipy
    - sklearn

N.B.: to pull nc_sim, in the root of this repository run:
    $ git sumbodule update --init
alternatively, when not using git, replace the directory nc_sim with the contents of the nc_sim git repository (https://github.com/akkeh/nc_sim.git).

==========================
When using this code, please cite:
    A.M. Houben, A.-C. Haeb, J. Garcia-Ojalvo \& J. Soriano, Reservoir computing in simulated neuronal cultures: Effect of network structure, (in press)
